  "historyNote": "#10464, eff 11-26-13, EXPIRED: 11-26-23 New. #13947, INTERIM, eff 4-30-24, EXPIRED: 10-27-24 New. #14128, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
